         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Counting in Families\n\nWhen we count, the numbers grow one step at a time. After 9 comes 10, then 11, 12... The numbers that share the same ten form a family: 20, 21, 22... are the family of 20.\n\nIn this game, three numbers from one family appear in order, but one of them is hidden. Look at the numbers before and after the hidden one and use the arrows to find the number that completes the sequence.\n\nEach correct answer moves you to the next level, with a new family: from 0 to 9, then from 10 to 19, and so on up to 90 to 99.",
